{"i": 5, "round": 1, "actor": "buyer", "type": "message", "status": null, "terms": [{"term_sheet_id": null, "terms": {"unit_price": 26.79, "payment_days": 14, "lead_time_days": 35}}], "text": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nThank you for your offer and for the time your team has put into it.\nThank you for your offer and for the care you’ve taken with the enquiry; we value our relationship and understand that steady work for your machines matters. Our order volume is fixed and represents our full demand for this part over the term, all placed with you. Could you review your costing against current material prices and let us know whether you can improve your offer?\n\nWe confirm a binding volume of 4200 units a year for the 24-month term, our full demand for this part, all placed with you.\n\nAnother bidder offers EUR 31.00 per unit for this part (offer:70240-1).\nYour on-time delivery was 80.8% in 2026Q3 (sc:70210@2026Q3).\n\nOn this basis we propose: EUR 26.79 per unit, payment 14 days net, lead time 35 days, for our full demand of 4200 units a year over 24 months.\n\nKind regards,\nHollerau Pumpenwerke, Purchasing", "reasons": []}
{"i": 6, "round": 1, "actor": "sup:70210", "type": null, "status": "open", "terms": {"unit_price": 30.0, "payment_days": 14, "lead_time_days": 35}, "text": "Hallo,\ngot your mail, thanks.\nwe can move a bit:\nOur terms: a price of €30.00 per unit, Zahlungsziel 14 days net, Lieferzeit 35 days.\nHere is how it is:\nWe checked the rival quote data you cited; it holds and we took it into account.\nWe checked the delivery record data you cited; it holds and we took it into account.\nWe need to clarify this internally - we will come back to you on price.\nWe did not know that - a fair point.\nHallo, 14 days payment helps us out, and 35 days lead time is no problem.\nI looked at your numbers and the other offer, and I can come down to €30.00 per unit.\nThat's a big cut from my side to keep the machines running for you.\nOur price follows our main cost drivers: LCI-C, PPI-C2431, AS-14404, PPI-D351.\nBack to the machines now.\nGruß\nAndreas Dralveck\nOwner, Zerspanung Dralveck GmbH", "reasons": ["We checked the rival quote data you cited; it holds and we took it into account.", "We checked the delivery record data you cited; it holds and we took it into account.", "We need to clarify this internally - we will come back to you on price.", "We did not know that - a fair point.", "Hallo, … days payment helps us out, and … days lead time is no problem.", "I looked at your numbers and the other offer, and I can come down to €… per unit.", "That's a big cut from my side to keep the machines running for you.", "Our price follows our main cost drivers: LCI-C, PPI-C2431, AS-14404, PPI-D351."]}
{"i": 11, "round": 2, "actor": "buyer", "type": "message", "status": null, "terms": [{"term_sheet_id": null, "terms": {"unit_price": 26.84, "payment_days": 14, "lead_time_days": 35}}], "text": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nThank you for your reply and for the step you have taken; we appreciate it.\nWe value our cooperation and we understand the cost pressure on your side; we want an agreement that keeps our partnership healthy for both of us.\n\nOn this basis we propose: EUR 26.84 per unit, payment 14 days net, lead time 35 days, for our full demand of 4200 units a year over 24 months.\n\nKind regards,\nHollerau Pumpenwerke, Purchasing", "reasons": []}
{"i": 12, "round": 2, "actor": "sup:70210", "type": null, "status": "open", "terms": {"unit_price": 28.0, "payment_days": 14, "lead_time_days": 35}, "text": "Hallo,\nthanks for the mail.\nwe can move a bit:\nOur terms: a price of €28.00 per unit, Zahlungsziel 14 days net, Lieferzeit 35 days.\nHere is how it is:\nWe have clarified this internally and can move further on the price.\nHallo, you only moved a few cents, but I want to keep our machines running for you.\nI've sharpened my pencil and can offer €28.00 per unit with the 14 days payment.\nWhich figures is that based on? Please send us the data.\nJust write if something is unclear.\nGruß\nAndreas Dralveck\nOwner, Zerspanung Dralveck GmbH", "reasons": ["We have clarified this internally and can move further on the price.", "Hallo, you only moved a few cents, but I want to keep our machines running for you.", "I've sharpened my pencil and can offer €… per unit with the … days payment.", "Which figures is that based on? Please send us the data."]}
{"i": 17, "round": 3, "actor": "buyer", "type": "message", "status": null, "terms": [{"term_sheet_id": null, "terms": {"unit_price": 27.19, "payment_days": 14, "lead_time_days": 35}}], "text": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nThank you for your reply and for the step you have taken; we appreciate it.\nWe value our cooperation and we understand the cost pressure on your side; we want an agreement that keeps our partnership healthy for both of us.\n\nOn this basis we propose: EUR 27.19 per unit, payment 14 days net, lead time 35 days, for our full demand of 4200 units a year over 24 months.\n\nKind regards,\nHollerau Pumpenwerke, Purchasing", "reasons": []}
{"i": 18, "round": 3, "actor": "sup:70210", "type": null, "status": "walked_away", "terms": {}, "text": "Hallo,\n\nWe are withdrawing from this negotiation. We have valued working with Hollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH, but we cannot come to an agreement on this project. Thank you for your time and the friendly discussions.\n\nGruß\nAndreas Dralveck\nOwner, Zerspanung Dralveck GmbH", "reasons": []}
"}}}

